# Dependencies and lockfile

Load [fix-dependency-security](.agents/skills/fix-dependency-security/SKILL.md) and [audit-allow-builds](.agents/skills/audit-allow-builds/SKILL.md) when changing deps or install policy.

## Non-negotiables

- Use **`pnpm`** only (not `npm install` / `yarn`).
- After lockfile changes: `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` (prefer `sfw pnpm install …` when changing deps).
- Re-run **`pnpm audit`**, then **`pnpm type-check`** and **`pnpm lint`**.
- Respect **`pnpm-workspace.yaml`**: `allowBuilds`, `strictDepBuilds`, `minimumReleaseAge` — do not weaken policy to “make install work”.
- Prefer real version upgrades over ignoring audit or deprecation warnings.
